    <div class="tab-content" id="tab-service">
      <h4>Service Line Decision Analysis</h4>
      <p>Every service line in a hospital generates both direct financial results (its own revenue minus its own costs) and indirect system effects (referrals it generates for other departments, community loyalty it builds, staff it helps recruit). A narrow financial analysis that ignores these system effects will systematically undervalue service lines that serve as "loss leaders" for the institution.</p>
      <table class="data-table">
